WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.018
Fancy your own little game, without any coding?

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.927
Just write down the kind of game you want.

3
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:11.139
One click, a short wait, and your wish is built in.

4
00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:14.759
Your new game runs right away in your browser.

5
00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.956
Try it: open Build a Flappy game and write your wish.
